+RMSNorm stages total about 39%; batch attention is 57–75% after assembly fusion.
+Native execution envelopes include binding/submission/device/fence time, not
+isolated kernel/IO time. Late batch/head folding and a batch QKV/cache split
+failed compiler legalization in that phase; both were withdrawn and retained.
